{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>HURRY, FIND THE WAY OUT!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Four of the most dangerous inmates of Dumpyland have escaped, all the guards have been alerted: they must be captured at any cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to become one of them, alone or with your friends, and escape from the mysterious park where you've been locked up?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693900/extras/IMG_1527__1_.gif?t=1746108805\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CHOOSE YOUR FIGHTER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick from the 4 escaped prisoners, each with a unique class, deadly abilities, and an unforgettable personality. You can even switch characters during the game to adapt your strategy to any situation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693900/extras/Selection.jpg?t=1746108805\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ENTER THE DUNGEON, BEAT THE BOSS, ESCAPE.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every area of the bizarre world of Dumpyland is filled with attractions, for the prisoners\u2019 punishment and the amusement of its inhabitants. Explore the dungeons, fight your way through the guards, reach the Bosses and face them with all your might. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693900/extras/IMG_9533.gif?t=1746108805\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DO YOU WANT MY SOUVENIRS OR NOT?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn keys and coins in the abandoned Arcade and by completing Park Challenges. Spend them to get awesome Dumpyland souvenirs and unlock new abilities. Power up your characters and continue your breakout, stronger than ever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693900/extras/shooop.gif?t=1746108805\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3693900?t=1746108805","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693900/6d710f087e9410d78cb78de45f9233a3225fdce1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746108805","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693900/294a37e1cbe6d53febc9c575305abdbe2ccd27f6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746108805","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693900/294a37e1cbe6d53febc9c575305abdbe2ccd27f6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746108805","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>HURRY, FIND THE WAY OUT!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Four of the most dangerous inmates of Dumpyland have escaped, all the guards have been alerted: they must be captured at any cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to become one of them, alone or with your friends, and escape from the mysterious park where you've been locked up?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693900/extras/IMG_1527__1_.gif?t=1746108805\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CHOOSE YOUR FIGHTER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick from the 4 escaped prisoners, each with a unique class, deadly abilities, and an unforgettable personality. You can even switch characters during the game to adapt your strategy to any situation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693900/extras/Selection.jpg?t=1746108805\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ENTER THE DUNGEON, BEAT THE BOSS, ESCAPE.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every area of the bizarre world of Dumpyland is filled with attractions, for the prisoners\u2019 punishment and the amusement of its inhabitants. Explore the dungeons, fight your way through the guards, reach the Bosses and face them with all your might. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693900/extras/IMG_9533.gif?t=1746108805\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DO YOU WANT MY SOUVENIRS OR NOT?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn keys and coins in the abandoned Arcade and by completing Park Challenges. Spend them to get awesome Dumpyland souvenirs and unlock new abilities. Power up your characters and continue your breakout, stronger than ever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693900/extras/shooop.gif?t=1746108805\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Oniria Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693900/f068d62012d3fd005004f0af63aa2cb34f929d6e/header.jpg?t=1746108805","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"ma